# Rust Harvester: "{2}, {T}, Exile an artifact card from your graveyard: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature, then it deals damage
# equal to its power to any target." On turn 3 Bot1's graveyard holds only Lightning Bolt, an instant, so the ability is refused
# (the artifact-card requirement; the Harvester is no longer summoning sick and Mox mana is untapped). Then Mishra's Bauble is
# sacrificed into the graveyard and the ability is offered: the Bauble is exiled as a cost, the counter makes the Harvester 2/2
# and it deals 2 (not 1: the counter is put on first) to Bot2, who was at 17 after Bot1's turn-1 Bolt. Menace is printed.

